                "headline": "Special Weather Statement issued November 10 at 4:15AM EST by NWS Jacksonville FL",
                "description": "Locally dense fog is expected to develop across portions of\nSoutheast Georgia and Northeast Florida through sunrise this\nmorning. Visibilities will fall to 1/2 mile or less in some\nlocations. Conditions will not improve until the mid morning hours\naround 9 am. The nature of the fog is such that visibilities will\nvary greatly over short distances. Motorists should be alert for\nrapidly changing conditions through sunrise. If driving, slow down\nand leave extra distance ahead of you in case a sudden stop is\nneeded.",
